Description: classic interactive fiction adventure
 Zork II: The Wizard of Frobozz is the second commercial installment of
 Infocom's classic Zork interactive-fiction trilogy. The player continues
 exploring the Great Underground Empire while confronting the Wizard of
 Frobozz and solving text-driven puzzles.
 .
 This package contains the MIT-licensed upstream Z-machine version 3 story
 image and a launcher that runs it with the Frotz interpreter.
